---
import { resume } from '../data/resume';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';
---
<section class="portfolio-intro container">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">LLM AGENT / ALGORITHMS & ENGINEERING</p>
    <h1>周骏炜<span class="accent">。</span><span class="intro-direction">研究 Agent 怎样执行与学习。</span></h1>
    <p class="intro-description">香港中文大学 AI 硕士在读。围绕 <strong>Agent Harness、Context Engineering 与后训练</strong>，实现可恢复的调查 Runtime，打通购物 Agent 的轨迹与训练链路。</p>
    <div class="intro-links"><a class="text-link" href={resume.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={withBase('about/')}>经历与技术方向 →</a><span>{resume.location}</span></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="intro-availability">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> LOOKING FOR AN INTERNSHIP</p>
    <strong>LLM Agent 算法 / 工程实习</strong>
    <p>执行框架 · 上下文组织 · Agentic RL</p>
    <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${resume.email}`}>联系我 ↗</a>
  </aside>
</section>
